# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Re-include converted model assets, which the probe runner and incident engine
# images bake in. Without this the deny-all rule above blocks every non-Go file,
# so the images would build fine and then fail at runtime with a missing model.
!hack/models/**
